---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy & Data Architecture" description="Compliance disclosure and zero-cookie technical declaration for Teqniqks Tech Dwelling." canonicalPath="/privacy">
  <section class="privacy-section">
    <div class="site-container">
      <div class="page-header">
        <h1 class="page-title">Privacy & Compliance Declaration</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          We consider surveillance capitalism and dark patterns antithetical to good software engineering. This site is engineered to collect zero personal surveillance data.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="privacy-card-stack">
        <!-- 1. Zero Cookies -->
        <article class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title">1. Zero Cookies & Zero Local Tracking Storage</h2>
          <p>
            This website stores <strong>strictly zero HTTP cookies</strong> on your device. We do not use <code>localStorage</code>, <code>sessionStorage</code>, or IndexedDB for behavioral tracking or device fingerprinting. You will never encounter a cookie consent banner on this site because there are no cookies to consent to.
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- 2. Third-Party Scripts & Fonts -->
        <article class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title">2. Zero Third-Party Surveillance Scripts</h2>
          <p>
            All typefaces (Space Grotesk, Sora, and JetBrains Mono) are self-hosted directly from our static edge origin. We make zero calls to Google Fonts, Adobe Typekit, Google Tag Manager, Meta Pixel, or third-party advertising exchanges. Your IP address is never leaked to foreign ad brokers when loading our pages.
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- 3. Formless Communications -->
        <article class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title">3. Contact Channels & Data Retention</h2>
          <p>
            We operate without online intake forms or customer relationship management (CRM) database backends. When you contact us via email, your message arrives directly in our secure email inbox. We do not sell, rent, or distribute your email address or project details to any third party.
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- 4. Legal Frameworks -->
        <article class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title">4. Regulatory Applicability</h2>
          <p>
            Our infrastructure and data practices align with the highest standards of international digital privacy:
          </p>
          <ul class="compliance-bullets">
            <li><strong>Sri Lanka Personal Data Protection Act (PDPA No. 9 of 2022):</strong> We uphold data minimization principles, processing no personal data without direct communicative intent.</li>
            <li><strong>EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR):</strong> By storing zero tracking cookies and making zero external tracking API calls, we respect the fundamental privacy rights of visitors from the European Economic Area.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="legal-disclaimer">
            <em>Legal Notice: This disclosure represents our verifiable technical architecture and does not constitute formal legal counsel. For contractual legal questions, please consult a licensed attorney.</em>
          </p>
        </article>

        <!-- 5. Open Source Licenses -->
        <article class="privacy-block">
          <h2 class="block-title">5. Open Source Licensing</h2>
          <p>
            The software, architectural components, and open utilities authored by Teqniqks are released under standard permissive open source licenses (MIT License / SIL Open Font License). Please consult individual project repositories on GitHub for specific license notices.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .site-container {
    max-width: var(--content-max-width);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--gutter);
  }

  .privacy-section {
    padding: var(--space-3xl) 0 var(--space-4xl);
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: var(--step-5);
    color: var(--color-raw-parchment);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
  }

  .page-lead {
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    max-width: 52ch;
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  .privacy-card-stack {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .privacy-block {
    background-color: var(--surface-elevated);
    border: 2px solid var(--border-timber);
    padding: var(--space-2xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-flat);
  }

  .block-title {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    color: var(--color-raw-parchment);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .privacy-block p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-m);
  }

  .privacy-block p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .compliance-bullets {
    margin: var(--space-m) 0 var(--space-l);
    padding-left: var(--space-l);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .compliance-bullets li {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  .compliance-bullets strong {
    color: var(--color-raw-parchment);
  }

  .legal-disclaimer {
    font-size: 0.8125rem !important;
    color: var(--color-raw-ash) !important;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--border-timber);
    padding-top: var(--space-m);
    margin-top: var(--space-m);
  }
</style>
